 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which services does billing-api depend on now?\n[2025-03-10] standup/atlas/2025-03-10: Dependency map update: the billing service needs the ledger (invoice postings). [2025-09-09] standup/boreal/2025-09-09: Changes to the billing API need a rollback plan attached to the pull request. [2025-09-08] standup/boreal/2025-09-08-2: New dependency for billing-api: feature-flags. Billing-api will gate the new invoice flow behind feature-flags; the reasoning is that the rollout needs a per-tenant kill switch. Boreal noticed that the notifier's request volume halved after the client rollout and pinged the owners.",
